    {
      "entityId": "fact.caldris.dossier.ordelain",
      "name": "Polity dossier — Ordelain",
      "components": [
        {
          "qualifiedTypeId": "game.core.world.fact",
          "value": {
            "status": "active",
            "summary": "Ordelain — the long river kingdom. Land and livelihood: the Aur's broad grain plain, paper reeds, cattle, ceramics, orchards, Rule: Queen Samira III, river judges, provincial governors, and hereditary canal offices. Character: formal debate, generosity at table, public storytelling, water-law jokes, and an Magic: licensed colleges study medicine, stars, law, and controlled ritual; unauthorized Old wound: Concord surveyors redirected the Aur, enriching some estates and drowning others. Current pressure: the river has returned toward its pre-Concord channel, reopening claims",
