    {
      "entityId": "fact.caldris.dossier.selucia",
      "name": "Polity dossier — Selucia",
      "components": [
        {
          "qualifiedTypeId": "game.core.world.fact",
          "value": {
            "status": "active",
            "summary": "Selucia — islands bound by bells and sail. Land and livelihood: olives, citrus, fish, wine, ship repair, coral, ceramics, pilgrimage, Rule: King Matteo and an island parliament whose members arrive late whenever the wind makes Character: musical processions, neighbourly feuds, sea rescue, dramatic hospitality, and Magic: island saints and sea stories abound; actual spellcasters often work as healers, Old wound: one island was traded by treaty without its delegates present. Current pressure: a wedding between Selucian and Ordelaini houses may settle maritime claims,",
            "provenance": "Caldris world bible — polity dossiers",
