    {
      "entityId": "fact.caldris.dossier.tessarane",
      "name": "Polity dossier — Tessarane",
      "components": [
        {
          "qualifiedTypeId": "game.core.world.fact",
          "value": {
            "status": "active",
            "summary": "Tessarane — high roads and open skies. Land and livelihood: dry plateau, horse and sheep herding, wheat valleys, glass, astronomy, Rule: Queen Ione and a court that travels seasonally among three royal residences. Character: direct questions, long-distance hospitality, star lore, public recitation, fierce Magic: stars are studied scientifically, devotionally, and magically by rival institutions Old wound: Concord calendars once fixed tax dates without regard for plateau seasons. Current pressure: a harmless comet has become a dangerous political canvas.",
